      "writtenOn": "2025-03-24T09:15:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I attempted to use `@FeatureFlag` for this test, but it complicates the maintenance of the entire TetheringConfigurationTest. This is because `@FeatureFlag` modifies the flag value before testing, while some tests dynamically modify the flag value within the test, such as `testChooseUpstreamAutomatically_FlagOverride` and `testChooseUpstreamAutomatically_FlagOverrideAfterT`. To accommodate this, I would need to separate one test into three similar tests, which differ only in their initial flag value. This would likely confuse future developers. Therefore, I prefer to maintain the current design. @jchalard@google.com, do you have any suggestions for this?",
